e&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  if (BrowserWindow.getAllWindows().length === 0) {&#10;    createMainWindow();&#10;  }&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 处理 macOS「关闭最后窗口不退出」的行为</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">app.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'window-all-closed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (process.platform </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'darwin'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    app.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">quit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// macOS 点击 Dock 图标时重新创建窗口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">app.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'activate'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (BrowserWindow.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getAllWindows</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    createMainWindow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"窗口间通信策略\">窗口间通信策略</h2><p>多窗口应用中窗口间的数据同步有三种策略：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>通过主进程中转</strong>：窗口 A → IPC → 主进程 → <code>webContents.send()</code> → 窗口 B。适合低频通信。</li>\n<li><strong>共享状态存储</strong>：所有窗口通过 IPC 读写主进程中的集中式状态（类似 Redux store in main），状态变更后广播通知所有窗口。</li>\n<li><strong>MessagePort 直连</strong>：主进程建立 MessageChannel，将两个 port 分别发送给两个窗口，之后两窗口直接通信。适合高频协作场景。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>每个 BrowserWindow 是独立渲染进程，窗口创建即进程创建</li>\n<li>使用 <code>show: false</code> + <code>ready-to-show</code> 事件避免白屏闪烁</li>\n<li>窗口状态持久化需处理多显示器和显示器变化的边缘情况</li>\n<li>WindowManager 模式集中管理多窗口的创建、查找和生命周期</li>\n<li>跨平台行为差异需针对 macOS/Windows/Linux 分别处理</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"ipc-communication-patterns\">IPC 通信设计模式</a>——窗口间通信的 IPC 基础</li>\n<li><a href=\"/hubs/frontend/browser-rendering-internals/\">浏览器渲染内部机制</a>——理解每个渲染进程内部的渲染管线</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"BrowserWindow 窗口管理与多窗口架构","id":"browserwindow-窗口管理与多窗口架构"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"BrowserWindow 配置体系","id":"browserwindow-配置体系"},{"level":2,"text":"窗口状态持久化","id":"窗口状态持久化"},{"level":2,"text":"多窗口管理器模式","id":"多窗口管理器模式"},{"level":2,"text":"跨平台窗口行为差异","id":"跨平台窗口行为差异"},{"level":2,"text":"窗口间通信策略","id":"窗口间通信策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"IPC 通信设计模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/electron-desktop/development/ipc-communication-patterns"},"next":{"title":"现代工程化工具链","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/electron-desktop/development/toolchain-engineering"}}